            <div class="field field--name-field-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p></p><h3><strong>Mission Statement</strong></h3>

<p>The New York City Housing Development Corporation (HDC) seeks to increase the supply of multi-family housing, stimulate economic growth and revitalize neighborhoods by financing the creation and preservation of affordable housing for low-, moderate-, and middle-income New Yorkers.</p>
